// A stack's lair guardian, fought by a party on the curve for its zone.
//
// This is the fight a run cannot walk away from: the guardian is the only
// boss the Stack fields and `STACK_BOSS_PORTAL_FRAGMENT_DROP` is the game's
// only source of the breaching currency, so a party that cannot clear one
// cannot leave the zone. `Lair` rather than `Stack` because
// `stack_encounter_pack` passes `allow_boss: false` and can never roll it.
//
// `Fresh` rather than the `deep-lair` template, deliberately: the tuner
// refuses a `Save` or `Template` player, since `party` is a `Fresh`-only
// field and a template's companions would be invisible to the freeze that
// protects species the player fields.
//
// The party is scrappers and nothing else, also deliberately. Every species
// named in a target's `party` is frozen out of the tuner's candidate, so
// fielding `rootkit` here — as `docs/measurements/2026-08-12-stack-lair-
// reachability.md`'s on-curve row does — would freeze the one species
// `full-group.ron` leaves it any room to move.
//
// Level 24 is what `balance_sim`'s curve says zone 3 demands, so this asks
// about a party that is exactly on its zone's curve rather than one that
// over-levelled to get here. Depth 2 because that is where the fight is in
// doubt: measured 2026-08-12, an on-curve party clears depth 1 at 95% and
// depth 2 at 15%, and depth 3 does not come back until level 70.
(
    player: Fresh(level: 24, zone: 3),
    equip: [
        (item: "plasma_router", tier: 0),
        (item: "bastion_lattice", tier: 0),
        (item: "singularity_matrix", tier: 0),
    ],
    // Standard-band weapon and armour, no module: the same "kitted the
    // player first" party `full-group.ron` fields, so the two targets differ
    // in the fight and not in who turned up to it.
    party: [
        (species: "scrapper", level: 12, equip: [
            (item: "arc_lance"), (item: "hardened_shell"),
        ]),
        (species: "scrapper", level: 12, equip: [
            (item: "arc_lance"), (item: "hardened_shell"),
        ]),
        (species: "scrapper", level: 12, equip: [
            (item: "arc_lance"), (item: "hardened_shell"),
        ]),
    ],
    encounter: Some(Lair(biome: Mainframe, depth: 2)),
    reps: 50,
    seed: 900,
)
